## Capability

Compose admitted primitives behind declared terminals and parameters. Bind a supported environmental input with explicit units and expose the subcircuit in the schematic.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Instantiate it twice and compare its PWM and filtered response against the reference. Missing or incompatible models produce a diagnostic before a run can claim success.

